1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Welcome to the official demonstration of the Sentinel AI Surveillance Platform.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,800
Submitted for the Gujarat Police Innovation Challenge 2026.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,500
We begin at the secure Officer Authentication Gateway.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,200
Every access is secured with Salted SHA-256 encryption and role-based clearance.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,300
Authorizing as Superintendent of Police, IT & Cyber, Badge GP-7829.

6
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:31,000
Here in the main Command Center, Sentinel unifies 30 official Gujarat Police CCTV cameras

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,800
across Ahmedabad, Gandhinagar, Surat, and Rajkot into a single interface.

8
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:42,500
The top KPI bar tracks live stream health, daily vehicle scans, and hotlist matches.

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:48,200
Operators can seamlessly filter feeds across all 26 state departments,

10
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:53,800
including Traffic Police, Civil Supplies, and RTO checkpoints.

11
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:59,500
Clicking on a live node activates our hardware-accelerated HLS video engine,

12
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:05,200
delivering smooth 60 frames-per-second streaming with browser GPU decoding.

13
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:11,000
Operators can click Scan Frame with AI to trigger on-demand vehicle classification

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,600
and high-accuracy OCR license plate recognition directly from the live feed.

15
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:22,200
When a suspect vehicle passes any camera, Sentinel's in-memory engine

16
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:28,000
executes sub-millisecond cross-referencing against active eGujCop and CCTNS FIR databases.

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,200
The control room receives an instant audio-visual siren with vehicle snapshot,

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:40,900
displaying GPS coordinates, FIR details, and one-click PCR intercept dispatch.

19
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:46,500
In the Trajectory and GIS module, entering a suspect registration number

20
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:51,800
reconstructs the vehicle's chronological journey across Gujarat junctions.

21
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:57,200
The interactive map renders numbered breadcrumbs from point 1 to point 4

22
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:02,100
with transit time deltas, heading vectors, and speed estimations for interception.

23
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:08,000
Finally, fulfilling Model 1 requirements, our Registry and Gap Analysis module

24
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,500
provides a centralized inventory of all state surveillance assets,

25
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:20,800
identifying coverage blind spots and aging cameras to scale up to 80,000 cameras.

26
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:28,000
Sentinel AI is 100% self-hosted with zero recurring cloud fees. Thank you.

